---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy for Constitution of Kenya (Offline) - Logicpath Systems">
    <section class="legal-page" style="padding-top: 120px; min-height: 100vh;">
        <div class="container reveal">
            <div class="glass-card" style="padding: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem);">
                <header style="margin-bottom: 3rem; text-align: center;">
                    <h1 class="gradient-text">Privacy Policy for Constitution of Kenya (Offline)</h1>
                    <p style="color: var(--text-secondary);"><strong>Last Updated:</strong> August 22, 2026</p>
                </header>

                <main class="legal-content">
                    <p>Logicpath Systems ("we," "us," or "our") operates the <strong>Constitution of Kenya (Offline)</strong> mobile application (the "App"). This page informs you of our policies regarding the collection, use, and disclosure of personal data when you use our App.</p>
                    <p>By using the App, you agree to the collection and use of information in accordance with this policy.</p>

                    <hr style="border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); margin: 2rem 0;" />
                    
                    <h2>1. Important Disclaimer: Non-Government Affiliation</h2>
                    <p><strong>This App is an independent educational tool.</strong><br/>Logicpath Systems is a private entity and is <strong>NOT affiliated with, endorsed by, or connected to the Government of Kenya or any of its agencies.</strong></p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>The content provided in this App is for educational and informational purposes only.</li>
                        <li>While we strive to keep the offline constitution text accurate and up-to-date, this App should not be considered an official legal reference. For official legal documents, please consult authoritative government sources, such as the Kenya Law Reports or the official government printer.</li>
                    </ul>

                    <h2>2. Offline Functionality & Data Privacy</h2>
                    <p>The primary feature of this App—reading the Constitution and taking practice quizzes—operates <strong>entirely offline</strong> on your device.</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li><strong>No Account Required:</strong> We do not require you to create an account, log in, or provide any personal information to use the core features of the App.</li>
                        <li><strong>Local Storage:</strong> Your bookmarks, reading progress, and quiz scores are saved locally on your device. We do not upload, sync, or store this personal data on our servers.</li>
                    </ul>

                    <h2>3. Information Collection, Advertising, and Use</h2>
                    <p>While your app usage and progress remain on your device, we use third-party services that may collect anonymized usage data to help us improve the App and to serve advertisements. <strong>We do not collect Personally Identifiable Information (PII) such as your name, email, or address.</strong></p>

                    <h3>3.1 Analytics (Google Analytics for Firebase)</h3>
                    <p>We use <strong>Google Analytics for Firebase</strong> (provided by Google LLC) to understand how users interact with the App and to identify crashes.</p>
                    <p>Firebase Analytics may collect:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li><strong>Usage Data:</strong> Which chapters are read most, quiz completion rates, and screen views.</li>
                        <li><strong>Device Information:</strong> Device model, OS version, and mobile network information.</li>
                        <li><strong>Crash Reports:</strong> Diagnostic data if the App crashes.</li>
                    </ul>
                    <p>This data is aggregated and anonymized. For more information, review the <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color: var(--accent-secondary);">Google Privacy Policy</a>.</p>

                    <h3>3.2 Advertising (Google AdMob)</h3>
                    <p>Our App uses <strong>Google AdMob</strong> to display advertisements to keep the app free. AdMob is provided by Google LLC.</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>AdMob may collect and use mobile advertising IDs (e.g., Android Advertising ID) and other device information to serve personalized or non-personalized ads.</li>
                        <li>You can opt out of personalized advertising by visiting your device's settings (e.g., enabling "Opt out of Ads Personalization" in Google Settings on Android).</li>
                    </ul>
                    <p>For detailed information, please see <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color: var(--accent-secondary);">How Google uses information from sites or apps that use our services</a>.</p>

                    <h2>4. Data Retention</h2>
                    <p>Because your reading progress and quiz data are stored locally on your device, we do not hold your personal data on our servers. Any analytics or advertising data collected by Google is retained according to Google's standard retention policies and is not tied to your identity.</p>

                    <h2>5. Security</h2>
                    <p>We value your trust in using our App. While no method of electronic transmission or storage is 100% secure, the offline nature of our core features inherently protects your reading activity from network interception.</p>

                    <h2>6. Children's Privacy</h2>
                    <p>Our App is intended for general audiences for educational purposes. We do not knowingly collect personally identifiable information from children under 13.</p>

                    <h2>7. Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>
                    <p>We may update our Privacy Policy from time to time. We will notify you of any changes by updating the "Last Updated" date on this page.</p>

                    <h2>8. Contact Us</h2>
                    <p>If you have any questions, suggestions, or concerns regarding this Privacy Policy or the App, please contact us at:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:contact@logicpathsystems.com" style="color: var(--accent-secondary);">contact@logicpathsystems.com</a></li>
                    </ul>
                </main>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</Layout>

<style>
    .legal-content h2 {
        color: var(--text-primary);
        margin-top: 2.5rem;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
        font-size: 1.5rem;
    }

    .legal-content h3 {
        color: var(--text-primary);
        margin-top: 2rem;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
        font-size: 1.25rem;
    }
    
    .legal-content p, .legal-content ul {
        color: var(--text-secondary);
        margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
        font-size: 1.05rem;
        line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .legal-content ul {
        padding-left: 2rem;
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
    }

    .legal-content li {
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }
</style>
